<p>A digital marketing side hustle is one of the few ways to earn extra money that also builds a career-grade skill. Every business with a website, an Instagram account or an email list needs someone to bring in customers, and most small businesses cannot afford a full-time marketer or an agency. That gap is where side hustlers make money: a few hours a week of SEO, social media, ads or email for clients who pay monthly.</p>
<p>This guide covers whether digital marketing is worth it as a side hustle, the 12 main types with typical pay, the free training worth your time, a 30/60/90-day launch plan, pricing, and how to land your first clients.</p>

